Return ONLY the updated marker-wrapped payload.

userContent.text:
Build an interactive figure using SVG.js.

CONCEPT: A hash table with chaining resolves collisions by storing all keys that hash to the same slot in a linked list, so the hash function h alone determines how the keys partition into chains and thus the cost of every operation.
KEY INSIGHT (what students should walk away understanding): The hash function is the only thing that shapes the chains: a good h spreads keys into short lists (near O(1) search), while a poor h collapses them into one long list, turning the hash table into an ordinary linked list.
DEMO STEPS: 4 guided steps — implement the step player in #ui

FULL BLUEPRINT:
